~ start
npcblack: Hey, I read about this strategy that some outsiders were using in battle.
npcred: Well, spit it out then.
npcblack: Apparently they took down one of the generals using the weather. One of them summoned a rainstorm, and the other froze the guy - some whack shit!
npcred: Wow, that's some intense strategy. You know who those folks were?
npcblack: Nope, all they would say to the newspapermen was "for justice" or something like that.
astryn: (For justice, huh? Seems word is getting around.)
npcred: Hah, they think they're some revolutionaries or something; can't wait till they face a big-city general, ain't gonna have the same luck then. Acirema's got the strongest army around!
npcblack: It might not hurt if they stir the pot a bit; hopefully they'll show up here next.
npcred: You crazy man, where's your respect for your people!
npcblack: Shit, them people don't care about us, man.
npcblack: We both know that…
astryn: (They come to accept this as their life.)
astryn: (Damn you, Vorkoth.)
do speaker.set_interactable(false)
=> END
